1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:05,600
I work at a hospital.

2
00:00:06,300 --> 00:00:11,300
I have been looking forward to this.

3
00:00:12,100 --> 00:00:17,100
Could you give me a hand?

4
00:00:17,900 --> 00:00:22,400
Let me figure it out.

5
00:00:23,200 --> 00:00:28,200
It is not as hard as it looks.

6
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:34,000
Take your time. There is no rush.

7
00:00:34,800 --> 00:00:39,800
What do you usually do after work?

8
00:00:40,600 --> 00:00:45,600
I would rather stay in tonight.

9
00:00:46,400 --> 00:00:51,400
That makes sense. I feel the same way.

10
00:00:52,200 --> 00:00:57,200
We can pick up where we left off.
